ża swojej kochanki Charlotte Inwood (Marlene Dietrich) . Wierząca w jego niewinność Eve Gill (Jane Wyman)udziela mu schronienia. Chcąc pomóc Jonathanowi, wspólnie ze swoim ojcem (Alastair Sim) stara się wyjaśnić tajemnicę morderstwa. Kiedy dziewczyna odkrywa kim jest zabójca, jej życie znajduje się w dużym niebezpieczeństwie...","popularity":2.5709,"poster_path":"/Agr6cqaIJn21UkjISXFqLaRRGmD.jpg","release_date":"1950-02-23","softcore":false,"video":false,"vote_average":6.828,"vote_count":370,"character":"Man Staring at Eve on Street (uncredited)","credit_id":"626ab50c95acf00e1a374414","order":14},{"adult":false,"backdrop_path":null,"genre_ids":[99],"id":210499,"title":"The Illustrated Hitchcock","original_language":"en","original_title":"The Illustrated Hitchcock","overview":"","popularity":0.7717,"poster_path":"/tWrMO33GM43zM3YeQcwAqal5Izh.jpg","release_date":"1972-07-15","softcore":false,"video":false,"vote_average":10.0,"vote_count":1,"character":"Self","credit_id":"52fe4d7dc3a368484e1ec141","order":0},{"adult":false,"backdrop_path":null,"genre_ids":[],"id":1171206,"title":"The Children of Alda Nuova","original_language":"en","original_title":"The Children of Alda Nuova","overview":"","popularity":0.8381,"poster_path":"/3WDhTW5UMjSuyaNng94Yx4K9nGV.jpg","release_date":"1962-06-05","softcore":false,"video":false,"vote_average":8.0,"vote_count":2,"character":"self - host","credit_id":"64ede40a83901801021e426d","order":1},{"adult":false,"backdrop_path":"/98qofsLB8HwPsmlq0HczQTt8BcS.jpg","genre_ids":[27,53],"id":571,"title":"Ptaki","original_language":"en","original_title":"The Birds","overview":"Kiedy atrakcyjna blondynka Melanie Daniels przybywa do Zatoki Bodega w pogoni za przystojnym kawalerem Mitchem Brennerem zostaje niespodziewanie zaatakowana przez mewę. Nagle tysiące oszalałych ptaków zaczynają gromadzić się w mieście. Ofiarami ich ataków padają zarówno dzieci jak i dorośli mieszkańcy miasta. Wkrótce Mitch i Melanie zmierzą się w walce o swoje życie ze śmiertelną, niewytłumaczalną siłą, której nikt nie potrafi powstrzymać.","popularity":8.9217,"poster_path":"/2KDeuWomS0vUZvbQf3Q80WeMcGJ.jpg","release_date":"1963-03-28","softcore":false,"video":false,"vote_average":7.51,"vote_count":4520,"character":"Pet Store Customer (uncredited)","credit_id":"627c1694f6596f00a6eb4c89","order":18},{"adult":false,"backdrop_path":"/3fWwpoAVj3mhgQxTnv2O0F1ElAM.jpg","genre_ids":[18,53,80],"id":543,"title":"Blackmail","original_language":"en","original_title":"Blackmail","overview":"","popularity":1.8679,"poster_path":"/7ioNEKouUkkWyv5tUDwVUd7BDRR.jpg","release_date":"1929-07-28","softcore":false,"video":false,"vote_average":6.5,"vote_count":282,"character":"Man on Subway (uncredited)","credit_id":"53235d809251411f85004ef2","order":9},{"adult":false,"backdrop_path":"/ncaLi5KOFjB3MuMLcc9wFFvhMqv.jpg","genre_ids":[99],"id":407392,"title":"Hollywood: The Selznick Years","original_language":"en","original_title":"Hollywood: The Selznick Years","overview":"","popularity":1.0467,"poster_path":"/pn8QhkrPxr3Z3JgWW4A6jUKEOZE.jpg","release_date":"1961-12-31","softcore":false,"video":false,"vote_average":4.4,"vote_count":5,"character":"Self (uncredited)","credit_id":"62c394126a300b007c28da86","order":9},{"adult":false,"backdrop_path":"/99f1r38wgc7Nb275XfhQ86iVqmM.jpg","genre_ids":[99],"id":509386,"title":"Hitchcock and Dial M","original_language":"en","original_title":"Hitchcock and Dial M","overview":"","popularity":1.272,"poster_path":"/fZR9k8kgWQh5VXmZPoAFPAXIjQ2.jpg","release_date":"2004-10-31","softcore":false,"video":false,"vote_average":6.4,"vote_count":8,"character":"Self (archive footage)","credit_id":"62e2c8d583ee67005e5c9972","order":8},{"adult":false,"backdrop_path":null,"genre_ids":[99],"id":522573,"title":"Topaz: An Appreciation by Film Critic/Historian Leonard Maltin","original_language":"en","original_title":"Topaz: An Appreciation by Film Critic/Historian Leonard Maltin","overview":"","popularity":1.3072,"poster_path":"/nNoZ0bHDt7VTJ7