":false,"video":false,"vote_average":6.0,"vote_count":6,"character":"Self (archive footage)","credit_id":"58e0c13fc3a3683d35018643","order":0},{"adult":false,"backdrop_path":null,"genre_ids":[99],"id":451648,"title":"Hitchcock, Selznick and the End of Hollywood","original_language":"en","original_title":"Hitchcock, Selznick and the End of Hollywood","overview":"","popularity":0.3807,"poster_path":null,"release_date":"1999-01-23","softcore":false,"video":false,"vote_average":7.8,"vote_count":6,"character":"Self (archive footage)","credit_id":"58ecd1d59251414b280570ea","order":1},{"adult":false,"backdrop_path":null,"genre_ids":[99],"id":449673,"title":"In the Master's Shadow: Hitchcock's Legacy","original_language":"en","original_title":"In the Master's Shadow: Hitchcock's Legacy","overview":"","popularity":0.9147,"poster_path":"/zEUSIdPRipZUAfV9ClgWju40u8E.jpg","release_date":"2008-10-07","softcore":false,"video":false,"vote_average":6.8,"vote_count":4,"character":"Self (archive footage)","credit_id":"58dcd917c3a3682273009562","order":0},{"adult":false,"backdrop_path":"/e0tZ5Kjg5mukFGcxEddCZymAxH4.jpg","genre_ids":[80,18],"id":22527,"title":"Niewłaściwy człowiek","original_language":"en","original_title":"The Wrong Man","overview":"Żona Manny`ego Balestrero, Rose, skarży się na ból zębów, ale na wizytę do dentysty brakuje jej pieniędzy. Mężczyzna postanawia pożyczyć gotówkę w firmie ubezpieczeniowej, w której Rose ma wykupioną polisę. Urzędnicy mylnie go identyfikują jako poszukiwanego złodzieja, który rok wcześniej napadł na firmę. Manny zostaje aresztowany.","popularity":2.4133,"poster_path":"/pO5XR2R56RAbVjdks9gGGn0fbOa.jpg","release_date":"1956-12-22","softcore":false,"video":false,"vote_average":7.138,"vote_count":619,"character":"Prologue Narrator (voice) (uncredited)","credit_id":"59fc6dc1925141137f02bf47","order":17},{"adult":false,"backdrop_path":"/8nCWeu8mgd3Wa0TtkSUIla0x9cF.jpg","genre_ids":[18,10749],"id":36056,"title":"Ring","original_language":"en","original_title":"The Ring","overview":"Jack Saunders i Bob Corby to dwaj bokserzy zakochani w jednej dziewczynie - Nellie. Dziewczyna wychodzi za Jacka, ale nie powodzi im się dobrze, więc Nellie zaczyna interesować się Bobem...","popularity":1.7086,"poster_path":"/VeNRpyspVlJzkrNAyszdGtmy9e.jpg","release_date":"1927-09-28","softcore":false,"video":false,"vote_average":5.9,"vote_count":115,"character":"Man-Dipping Attraction Worker (uncredited)","credit_id":"5a11a107c3a368628605436d","order":8},{"adult":false,"backdrop_path":"/15HEZcSKtLcl69avXfmjoIJBuay.jpg","genre_ids":[9648,53],"id":940,"title":"Starsza pani znika","original_language":"en","original_title":"The Lady Vanishes","overview":"Podczas podróży pociągiem znika starsza pani. Jedna z jej współpasażerek, młoda Angielka Iris Henderson (Margaret Lockwood), zaintrygowana tym, postanawia odnaleźć kobietę. Nie zdaje sobie sprawy, iż zdarzenie z pociągu to jedynie element pewnej skomplikowanej intrygi...","popularity":2.8707,"poster_path":"/qyP7W58Z8BUwl2tL1UE1VVXEU0K.jpg","release_date":"1938-10-07","softcore":false,"video":false,"vote_average":7.425,"vote_count":1040,"character":"Man in London Railway Station (uncredited)","credit_id":"5a16888a0e0a2612d9007513","order":19},{"adult":false,"backdrop_path":"/dyMNw0N06GgdhVhXxkxUiAqon2u.jpg","genre_ids":[99,36,10752],"id":254642,"title":"German Concentration Camps Factual Survey","original_language":"en","original_title":"German Concentration Camps Factual Survey","overview":"","popularity":0.8337,"poster_path":"/z60nncQ3fdMOQP7K8sduljE33rx.jpg","release_date":"2017-01-06","softcore":false,"video":false,"vote_average":7.3,"vote_count":17,"character":"Self (archive footage)","credit_id":"5a991f7f92514128be0066ae","order":5},{"adult":false,"backdrop_path":"/6QrmVxmjSfwWD17xRzg86Ve0Mnu.jpg","genre_ids":[99],"id":186702,"title":"Show-Business at War","original_language":"en","original_title":"Show-Business at War","overview":"","popularity":1.2272,"poster_path":"/bUmtQnpHqBKmIdPLgb2GCzuNW5i.jpg","release_date":"1943-05-21","softcore":false,"video":false,"vote_average":7.0,"vote_count":4,"character":"Self","credit_id":"5ab5da65c3a3680a28004213","order":34},{"adult":false,"backdrop_path":null,"genre_ids":[99],"id":471198,"title":"The Universal Story","original_language":"en","original_title":"The Universal Story","overview":"","popularity":1.2461,"poster_path":"/QmEOPgTZ9hELnWSmfzelaqAriU.jpg","release_date":"1996-04-21","softcore":false,"video":false,"vote_average":8.0,"vote_count":4,"character":"Self (archive footage)","credit_id":"5b6be8399251410341030a4b","order":4},{"adult":false,"backdrop_path":"/o9QuotgupLq34zYyzFrfd4TrimC.jpg","genre_ids":[53,9648],"id":8208,"title":"Człowiek, który wiedział za dużo","original_language":"en","original_title":"The Man Who Knew Too Much","overview":"Brytyjskie małżeństwo Lawrence'ów zaprzyjaźnia się podczas pobytu w Szwajcarii z agentem specjalnym. Podczas wieczorku tanecznego tańczący z Jill Lawrence zostaje zastrzelony, a zaraz potem przestępcy porywają córkę Larence'ów Betty. Chcą w ten sposób zmusić małżeństwo do milczenia i zapewnić sobie bezpieczeństwo podczas dokonywania planowanego zamachu. Lawrence'owie wracają do Londynu i tam biorą sprawę we własne ręce.","popularity":2.9255,"poster_path":"/qghwbSfQblFYRFq675uK5qDGr3w.jpg","release_date":"1934-12-09","softcore":false,"video":false,"vote_average":6.511,"vote_count":452,"character":"Man in Raincoat Passing Bus (uncredited)","credit_id":"5b737df9c3a36818881b7b82","order":18},{"adult":false,"backdrop_path":"/qBoJAPXfvXi8WmAb4fAF8JO3DVl.jpg","genre_ids":[99],"id":367966,"title":"Harold and Lillian: A Hollywood Love Story","original_language":"en","original_title":"Harold and Lillian: A Hollywood Love Story","overview":"","popularity":0.926,"poster_path":"/I2iRQYtBC0rJVirnoPCKLK6Cfl.jpg","release_date":"2017-02-01","softcore":false,"video":false,"vote_average":6.85,"vote_count":20,"character":"Self (archive footage)","credit_id":"5b7382560e0a267ee51aff65","order":18},{"adult":false,"backdrop_path":"/mi0PhGBqRnJXuVqoAjFYIN89kWR.jpg","genre_ids":[53,10749,9648],"id":2762,"title":"Młody i niewinny","original_language":"en","original_title":"Young and Innocent","overview":"Dreszczowiec \"Młody i niewinny\" opowiada historię młodego mężczyzny, który zostaje niesłusznie oskarżony o zabicie pewnej kobiety. Reżyser stara się sięgnąć do podświadomości bohatera, w sferę namiętności i odruchów, jednocześnie nie pozostawiając w spokoju widza... Film stanowi interesującą adaptację powieści Josephine Tey. Hitchcock tradycyjnie wprowadza do swego obrazu, obok elementów typowych dla thrillera, również sporo uroku i humoru.","popularity":1.9655,"poster_path":"/knc0wcxarPM6Qy3uOm1RV38JGzS.jpg","release_date":"1937-02-17","softcore":false,"video":false,"vote_average":6.571,"vote_count":255,"character":"Photographer Outside Courthouse (uncredited)","credit_id":"5c6ad464c3a36843c6e481e1","order":15},{"adult":false,"backdrop_path":null,"genre_ids":[99],"id":602190,"title":"Cinema: Alfred Hitchcock","original_language":"en","original_title":"Cinema: Alfred Hitchcock","overview":"","popularity":0.5579,"poster_path":"/pKK7S9WxzA6v9ipjChPioJfIPeP.jpg","release_date":"1966-05-20","softcore":false,"video":true,"vote_average":0.0,"vote_count":0,"character":"Himself","credit_id":"5cd99e7a0e0a2666decb3688","order":0},{"adult":false,"backdrop_path":"/oa6yoeeZtjxdgzAcZtbCSW3GEE9.jpg","genre_ids":[9648,10749,53],"id":11462,"title":"Podejrzenie","original_language":"en","original_title":"Suspicion","overview":"John Aysgarth (Cary Grant), bogaty i niestały w uczuciach mężczyzna, wiąże się z dziewczyną (Joan Fontaine), wywodzącą się z statecznej rodziny. Małżeństwo nie jest udane, bowiem mąż nie zamierza się ustatkować, nie poświęca żonie czasu, przyłapywany jest przez nią na kłamstwach. Skutkuje to narastającą nieufnością wobec niego, kobieta zaczyna się obawiać o swoje życie...","popularity":3.2674,"poster_path":"/clWNlzlbyaEoIK63lcFjq